{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫電視（TVB）年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》盛大舉行，當晚紅地氈星光熠熠，眾星盛裝亮相爭妍鬥麗。</p><p>向來身材出眾的藝人鄧凱文亦華麗登場，以一襲淺色閃亮超低胸吊帶晚裝驚艷全場，成為傳媒鏡頭追逐的焦點。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;鄧</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:15:37.977456+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:24:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:08:55.082341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:08:55.082341+00:00","content_hash":"4c07284abe5578a9158ed1d05f35d0025896e7ef2cee910240325182207555c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}